---
title: "team_deletion_cascade (stem-bot-v2: table.sql)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_delete_team: DELETE from member.teams WHERE id = team_id
    q_delete_team --> q_cascade: ON DELETE CASCADE triggered
    q_cascade --> q_remove_relations: DELETE member_team_relations WHERE team_id = id
    q_cascade --> q_remove_leaders: DELETE team_leaders WHERE team_id = id
    q_remove_relations --> q_finalize: team member relations removed
    q_remove_leaders --> q_finalize: team leader relations removed
    q_finalize --> [*]: team and all associations deleted

    note right of q_cascade
        INV-001: Deleting a team cascades to member_team_relations
        INV-002: Deleting a team cascades to team_leaders
        INV-003: Members themselves are NOT deleted when team is removed
    end note
